# Allow-list: the build context holds only tracked build inputs. Private
# config, .env*, data/, .opencode/, legacy/, target/, art and node_modules
# never enter any stage.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/
!boss/bosses.yaml
!boss/knowledge/
!web/package.json
!web/bun.lock
!web/tsconfig.base.json
!web/apps/
!web/packages/

# Re-excluded inside allowed trees (local installs, builds, stray files).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
